+      "Traits": "Innate Spellcasting (Psionics). Intelligence, save DC 13, with no components. The swarm casts only while above half HP. Command, Comprehend Languages, and Detect Thoughts are at will. Confusion and Dominate Monster are each once per day, with expended uses recovered after a long rest.\nSwarm. The swarm and other creatures can occupy the same space. It fits through any opening a Tiny rat could use. It cannot regain HP or gain temporary HP.\nTelepathic Shroud. The swarm is immune to effects that would sense its emotions or read its thoughts and to all divination spells.",
+      "Actions": "Bites. Melee weapon attack +5 to hit, reach 0 ft., one target in the swarm’s space. A hit deals 14 (4d6) piercing damage. At half HP or lower it deals 7 (2d6) piercing instead.",
+      "Damage and condition defenses": "Resists bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage. Immune to charmed, frightened, grappled, paralyzed, petrified, prone, restrained, and stunned.",
